    %vpi_call/w 3 299 "$display", "     Without thermal noise or an asymmetric kick (such as Spectre ic), the analog" {0 0 0};
    %vpi_call/w 3 300 "$display", "     circuit can remain stuck at delta_V = 0 indefinitely." {0 0 0};
    %vpi_call/w 3 301 "$display", "   - In Digital FPGA, values are strictly binary 0 or 1. The hardware reset (btnC/sw[15])" {0 0 0};
